><li>1 HDMI 2.1;&nbsp;<\/li><li>1 conector combo de auriculares\/micr\u00f3fono est\u00e9reo;&nbsp;<\/li><li>1 RJ-45;&nbsp;<\/li><li>2 USB Type-C\u00ae con velocidad de se\u00f1al de 10 Gbps (suministro de energ\u00eda por USB, DisplayPort&#8482; 2.1)<\/li><\/ul><li><b>Sonido<\/b>:&nbsp;Altavoces est\u00e9reo dobles, micr\u00f3fonos de matriz doble<\/li><li><b>Teclado<\/b>:&nbsp;Teclado HP Premium Collaboration: resistente a derrames, con retroiluminaci\u00f3n y teclado num\u00e9rico<\/li><li><b>Inal\u00e1mbrico<\/b>:&nbsp;Tarjeta inal\u00e1mbrica Realtek Wi-Fi 6E RTL8852CE (2x2) y Bluetooth\u00ae 5.3<\/li><li><b>Potencia<\/b>:&nbsp;Adaptador de alimentaci\u00f3n HP Smart de 45 W AC externo<\/li><li><b>Lector de huellas digitales<\/b> Sensor de huellas dactilares<br><\/li><li>Tipo de bater\u00eda:&nbsp;Bater\u00eda HP de 3 celdas de larga duraci\u00f3n, ion-litio, 42&nbsp;Wh<\/li><li>Certificado Energy Star: Certificaci\u00f3n ENERGY STAR\u00ae<\/li><li><b>Dimensiones m\u00ednimas<\/b>&nbsp;(ancho x fondo x alto):&nbsp;35,94 x 23,39 x 1,99 cm<\/li><li><b>Peso<\/b>:&nbsp;A partir de 1,79 k<\/li><\/ul><br><p><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"HP","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":2.41,"unit_price":944.23,"unit_price_tax":944.23,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Portatiles","sub_category":"Portatiles","quantity":2,"brand":"HP","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_hpp-pro%20816c7ea_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":939.23}}},"0196803947960":{"result":false,"need_alert":false,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["0196803947960",false],"wholesale_price":[379,false],"price":[384,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["",false],"weig